From: Anish Kadamathikuttiyil Karthikeyan Pillai
 <anish.kadamathikuttiyil-karthikeyan-pillai@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Sep 2025 13:20:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 088/190] dt-bindings: iio: adc: versal-sysmon: AI engine
 thermal monitoring

commit 96f828c080597ede91f501b527dc084ea7fdf692 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Add temperature child equivalent to supply child entries.
The sysmon temperature remote satellites can be exposed over this.

The reg property is the satellite number in the register database.
It is used for getting the register offset value. The xlnx,aie-temp
shows whether the temp child node is in close proximity with
AI engine. The name of the temperature satellite is added as the
xlnx,name property.

There is a limitation of reg collision between supply and temp
child nodes. Supply range is from 0 to 159 and temp range is from
1 to 64.

Signed-off-by: Anish Kadamathikuttiyil Karthikeyan Pillai <anish.kadamathikuttiyil-karthikeyan-pillai@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250910122035.2046921-2-anish.kadamathikuttiyil-karthikeyan-pillai@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 .../bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml  | 74 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 74 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml
index 28cb2327d094..6c4337afd095 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/adc/xlnx,versal-sysmon.yaml
@@ -90,6 +90,32 @@ patternProperties:
       - xlnx,name
 
     additionalProperties: false
+  "^temp@([1-9]|[1-5][0-9]|6[0-4])$":
+    type: object
+    description:
+      Represents the sysmon temperature satellites.
+
+    properties:
+      reg:
+        minimum: 1
+        maximum: 64
+        description:
+          The sysmon temperature satellite number.
+
+      xlnx,name:
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/string
+        description:
+          Name of temperature satellite exposed
+
+      xlnx,aie-temp:
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/flag
+        description:
+          If present it indicates the temperature satellite is in
+          close proximity with AI Engine
+
+    required:
+      - reg
+      - xlnx,name
 
 required:
   - compatible
@@ -154,5 +180,53 @@ examples:
                     reg = <159>;
                     xlnx,name = "vccint_ir";
             };
+
+            temp@7 {
+              xlnx,aie-temp;
+              reg = <7>;
+              xlnx,name = "aie-temp-ch0";
+            };
+
+            temp@8 {
+              xlnx,aie-temp;
+              reg = <8>;
+              xlnx,name = "aie-temp-ch1";
+            };
+
+            temp@14 {
